# git apply needs byte-exact context lines: the harness applies
# harness/ymir_*.patch to the fetched (LF) Ymir source tree, so patch files
# must always check out with LF endings. Without this rule a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true smudges the patches to CRLF and `git apply` fails
# with "patch does not apply" even though the committed blobs are correct.
*.patch text eol=lf
